	  <Description>The complete HoloNET .NET Holochain Development Kit -- a single meta-package that brings together HoloNET Client (zome calls, Admin API, async/event model), HoloNET ORM (HoloNETEntryBase, HoloNETAuditEntryBase, HoloNETCollection, HoloNETObservableCollection), HoloNET Manager (WPF UI showcasing all features), HyperNET (lag-free P2P gaming networking for Unity/Unreal), and the WEB5 STAR ODK No/Low Code Generator. Targets Holochain 0.6.x with Kitsune2 networking. Build hApps faster -- map C# models onto Rust structs, auto-generate Rust and C# code from metadata, and deploy to any OASIS provider. Explore the full OASIS Omniverse ecosystem at https://holonet.oasisomniverse.one -- Source: https://github.com/holochain-open-dev/holochain-client-csharp</Description>
